{%- comment -%}
  _includes/theme-toggle.liquid — Stage 6.

  A single two-state icon <button>: sun bound to light, crescent moon bound to
  dark. Both glyphs stay in the DOM at all times, stacked and absolutely
  positioned by toggle.css — neither is ever display:none, which is what lets
  the outgoing glyph spin-and-fade out instead of vanishing.

  Visibility is driven entirely by CSS, keyed off [data-theme] on <html> (and
  prefers-color-scheme when no explicit choice has been made yet) — see
  toggle.css. theme.js only ever flips that attribute and localStorage.theme;
  it never swaps an icon directly, so the glyph shown can never drift out of
  sync with the palette that's actually applied.

  Hidden entirely without the `js` class — `html:not(.js) .theme-toggle` in
  toggle.css. That class is added by the frozen inline script in base.liquid,
  before first paint. A toggle with no working write path (theme.js is
  `defer`red and hasn't run yet) must be absent, not dead.

  aria-label names the NEXT action, not the current state — "Switch to dark
  theme" is unambiguous in a way "Dark" is not. theme.js keeps it in sync with
  the effective theme (explicit choice, or the OS preference) on load and on
  every click.
{%- endcomment -%}
<button type="button" id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle" aria-label="Switch to dark theme">
  <svg class="theme-toggle__icon theme-toggle__icon--sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5"></circle>
    <path d="M12 1.5v2.25M12 20.25v2.25M4.393 4.393l1.591 1.591M18.016 18.016l1.591 1.591M1.5 12h2.25M20.25 12h2.25M4.393 19.607l1.591-1.591M18.016 5.984l1.591-1.591"></path>
  </svg>
  <svg class="theme-toggle__icon theme-toggle__icon--moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path d="M20.354 15.354A9 9 0 0 1 8.646 3.646 9.003 9.003 0 1 0 20.354 15.354Z"></path>
  </svg>
</button>
